    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote25" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">$50,000,000 in advances from National Fuel Gas Company mature on 10/1/2026 and have been reclassified to Account 233 in recognition of the current status of the loan.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value25" xlink:to="footnote25" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="25" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote27" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Supply Corporation uses the fixed asset model provisions of FERC Order 581 in accounting for its storage gas recorded in Account 117.4.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value27" xlink:to="footnote27" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="27" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote31" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">In February 2025, Supply Corporation recorded a base gas sale of 126,957dth at a gain of $322,437. Supply Corporation received $412,610 in proceeds from this sale. This sale was authorized by FERC in Docket No. CP22-482-000.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value31" xlink:to="footnote31" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="31" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote32" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">On March 6, 2025, Supply Corporation borrowed $25,000,000 from the Company at an interest rate of 5.708%. The note matures on March 15, 2030. On the same date, Supply Corporation also borrowed $275,000,000 from the Company at an interest rate of 6.119%. This note matures on March 15, 2035.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value32" xlink:to="footnote32" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="32" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote33" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Supply Corporation redeemed $125,000,000 of 5.358% notes and $150,000,000 of 5.779% notes with the proceeds received from Associated Companies in March 2025. The 5.358% and 5.779% notes were redeemed for $125,271,363 and $151,405,826, respectively, plus accrued interest. The call premiums were recorded in Account 189, Unamortized Loss on Reacquired Debt, in March 2025.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value33" xlink:to="footnote33" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="33" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote34" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">
            <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Net activity for the quarter (column c) and year (column d), including gas retainage charged and fuel use, increased inventory by 561,429 dth.</xhtml:span>
          </xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value34" xlink:to="footnote34" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="34" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote35" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">This line item includes Gas Received from Shippers as Fuel and Company Use &amp; Surface Operating Allowance. The majority is Fuel and Company Use.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value35" xlink:to="footnote35" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="35" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote36" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">The line item represents gas received from shippers as Transportation and Storage Lost &amp; Unaccounted For.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value36" xlink:to="footnote36" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="36" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote42" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Includes volumes related to lease agreement with Empire Pipeline totaling 2,229,332 dth for the quarter and year which are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value42" xlink:to="footnote42" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="42" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote43" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">These volumes are also included in the volumes on line 20. These volumes are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value43" xlink:to="footnote43" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="43" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote44" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">This line represents all fuel used by Supply Corporation. These volumes are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value44" xlink:to="footnote44" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="44" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote45" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">These volumes represent other measurement adjustments. These volumes are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value45" xlink:to="footnote45" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="45" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote48" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 16.4256%; height: 147px;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 42px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 43.6584%; height: 42px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 14.8562%; height: 42px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the quarter (column c) and year (column d)</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 21px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 43.6584%; height: 21px;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Gathering System Losses</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 14.8562%; height: 21px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">$71,016</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 21px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 43.6584%; height: 21px;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Transmission System Losses</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 14.8562%; height: 21px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">518,747</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 21px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 43.6584%; height: 21px;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Storage Losses</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 14.8562%; height: 21px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">68,397</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 21px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 43.6584%; height: 21px;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Other Losses / (Gains)</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 14.8562%; height: 21px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">16,538</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 21px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 43.6584%; height: 21px;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Total Gas Losses &amp; Gas Unaccounted For</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 14.8562%; height: 21px; border-top: 1pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">$674,698</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">"Gathering System Losses" shown here are a combination of system losses and measurement error. Quantities of each of these system losses and measurement error cannot be determined separately.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">"Transmission System Losses" shown here are a combination of system losses and measurement error. Quantities of each of these system losses and measurement error cannot be determined separately.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">"Other Losses/(Gains)" represent measurement adjustments (related to transmission, storage and gathering losses/(gains)) made to the 12/1/25 through 2/28/26 flow period subsequent to 2/28/26 for the quarter (column c) and year (column d) (16,538 dth loss).</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value48" xlink:to="footnote48" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="48" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote49" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, excess gas retained for each month is valued at 100% of the monthly cashout index rate for the respective month for columns f, g, h and i.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value49" xlink:to="footnote49" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="49" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote50" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, transmission volumes also include gas coming on to the transmission system from gathering since there is no separate shrinkage retained on gathering volumes.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value50" xlink:to="footnote50" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="50" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote51" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, gas used in transmission compressors is allocated between the rate types (columns b, c, and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for transmission per line 4 on page 521.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value51" xlink:to="footnote51" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="51" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote52" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, gas used in storage compressors is allocated between the rate types (columns b, c, and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for storage per line 6 on page 521.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value52" xlink:to="footnote52" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="52" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote53" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, total gas used for other deliveries and gas used for other operations is allocated between rate types (column b, c, and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for each contract type per lines 2-6 on page 521. These amounts are due to measurement adjustments.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value53" xlink:to="footnote53" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="53" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote54" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, gathering losses are allocated between the rate types (columns b, c and d) based on percentage of gas transported for transmission per line 4 on page 521.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value54" xlink:to="footnote54" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="54" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote55" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, transmission losses are allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for transmission per line 4 on page 521.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value55" xlink:to="footnote55" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="55" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote56" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, storage losses are allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for storage per line 6 on page 521.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value56" xlink:to="footnote56" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="56" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote57" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">For the months of January, February, and March, other losses (gains) represent measurement adjustments (related to transmission, storage and gathering losses (gains)) made to the 12/1/25 through 2/28/26 flow period subsequent to 2/28/26, and as a result, are allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of total shipper supplied gas transported per line 7 on page 521.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value57" xlink:to="footnote57" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="57" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote66" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI93-5-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value66" xlink:to="footnote66" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="66" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote67" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>18 CFR Section 154.402 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value67" xlink:to="footnote67" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="67" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote68" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>RS92-21-004, 006, 007, 008 &amp; 009 provided the authorization for this deferral</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value68" xlink:to="footnote68" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="68" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote69" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI02-1-000 and RM02-7-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value69" xlink:to="footnote69" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="69" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote71" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Stipulation and Agreement filed on May 22, 2012 under Docket No. RP12-88-000 and subsequently approved by the Commission on August 6, 2012 provided authorization for this deferral. Activity for the year includes any over-collection or under-collection of retained quantities as well as an adjustment to revalue the liability at the March 31, 2026 100% cashout index rate.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value71" xlink:to="footnote71" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="71" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote72" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Under Supply Corporation's tariff, this amount represents an overrecovery of transportation and storage cost adjustment costs under Rate Schedule EFT</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value72" xlink:to="footnote72" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="72" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote73" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Supply Corporation reclassifies regulatory assets in Account 182.3 that have credit balances to regulatory liabilities in Account 254</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value73" xlink:to="footnote73" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="73" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote74" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI07-1-000 provided the authorization for this deferral</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value74" xlink:to="footnote74" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="74" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote75" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">In February 2026, Supply Corporation transferred 6,283,000 Dth of base gas deemed non-recoverable from account 117.1 - Gas Stored-Base Gas to account 352.3 - Non-Recoverable Natural Gas, a component of Utility Plant on the balance sheet. The book value of this transaction was $5,449,246.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value75" xlink:to="footnote75" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="75" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote76" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">In February 2026, Supply Corporation transferred 6,283,000 Dth of base gas deemed non-recoverable from account 117.1 - Gas Stored-Base Gas to account 352.3 - Non-Recoverable Natural Gas, a component of Utility Plant on the balance sheet. The book value of this transaction was $5,449,246.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value76" xlink:to="footnote76" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="76" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote78" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">$50,000,000 in advances from National Fuel Gas Company mature on 10/1/2026 and have been reclassified to Account 233 in recognition of the current status of the loan.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value78" xlink:to="footnote78" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="78" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote80" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI02-1-000 and RM02-7-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value80" xlink:to="footnote80" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="80" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote81" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>RM95-4-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value81" xlink:to="footnote81" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="81" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote82" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Supply Corporation reclassifies regulatory assets in Account 182.3 that have credit balances to regulatory liabilities in Account 254.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value82" xlink:to="footnote82" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="82" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote83" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI93-5-000 provides the regulatory authority for this deferral and was reaffirmed by Docket No. PL19-2-000.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value83" xlink:to="footnote83" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="83" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote84" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Amount represents the cumulative FAS158 adjustment to record the actuarial determined Pension Benefit Obligation (PBO) adjustment for Supply's portion of National Fuel Gas Company's Executive Retirement Plan and Tophat Plan, which are non-qualified plans.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value84" xlink:to="footnote84" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="84" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote85" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;">Amount represents the cumulative FAS158 adjustment to record the actuarial determined Pension Benefit Obligation (PBO) adjustment for </xhtml:span>Supply's<xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"> portion of National Fuel Gas Company's Executive Retirement Plan and </xhtml:span>Tophat<xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"> Plan, which are non-qualified plans.</xhtml:span></xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value85" xlink:to="footnote85" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="85" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote86" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Total Receipts for Lines 4, 5 and 7 reflect the flow period of 1/1/26 through 3/31/26. All other lines reflect the flow period of 12/1/25 through 2/28/26.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value86" xlink:to="footnote86" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="86" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote87" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Net negative imbalances decreased inventory by 17,759 dth for the quarter and year.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value87" xlink:to="footnote87" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="87" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote88" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Interruptible commodity volumes of 319,149 dth for the quarter and year. The total volume of 384,836 dth for the quarter and year are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value88" xlink:to="footnote88" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="88" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote89" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Includes volumes related to lease agreements with Empire Pipeline, Tennessee Gas Pipeline and Transcontinental Gas Pipeline totaling 21,706,789 dth for the quarter and year which are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value89" xlink:to="footnote89" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="89" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote90" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Total Deliveries &amp; Unaccounted For for Lines 19, 20 and 22 reflect the flow period of 1/1/26 through 3/31/26. All other lines reflect the flow period of 12/1/25 through 2/28/26.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value90" xlink:to="footnote90" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="90" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrli:xbrl>
